    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naughty Chat is a text-based chat simulator in which you help a girl named Amelia with her master's thesis. Luckily for her, you are just the right person to help her...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/ac1a701c2c3e336b9898298ebaff02dc.poster.avif?t=1752894103\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/ac1a701c2c3e336b9898298ebaff02dc.webm?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/ac1a701c2c3e336b9898298ebaff02dc.mp4?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbb EARINING MONEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a graduate student who earns money by helping other students with their homework. Even though you are not an expert in every subject, you help everyone with any task by using AI assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/c831bd4200d42522ccbb008bc4756632.poster.avif?t=1752894103\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/c831bd4200d42522ccbb008bc4756632.webm?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/c831bd4200d42522ccbb008bc4756632.mp4?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\ufe0fAMELIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amelia, a rich girl you\u2019ve met a party, is your new client - she needs help with her master's thesis. The assignment is much harder than what you usually do, you've never done anyone's thesis before, but she offers you a large sum of money for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After some consideration, you decide to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/fecfbd5b8de64e99a68b9ed3298aa0c5.poster.avif?t=1752894103\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/fecfbd5b8de64e99a68b9ed3298aa0c5.webm?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/fecfbd5b8de64e99a68b9ed3298aa0c5.mp4?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd00 WHAT WILL YOU DO?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing different options in the dialog will give you different results, be sure to try them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/d2535682c1a409c061592b9769f7eec9.poster.avif?t=1752894103\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/d2535682c1a409c061592b9769f7eec9.webm?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/d2535682c1a409c061592b9769f7eec9.mp4?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd1eNAUGHTY STUFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the story, you'll slowly win Amelia\u2019s favor and receive naughty pictures from her. Once she sends you a picture, you unlock it in the gallery, which you can access at any time during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/9ff6b3c288d76bc4a8fc057ddc05d00f.poster.avif?t=1752894103\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/9ff6b3c288d76bc4a8fc057ddc05d00f.webm?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/9ff6b3c288d76bc4a8fc057ddc05d00f.mp4?t=1752894103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naughty Chat will give you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0About 2 hours of gameplay \ud83d\udd50 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50+ unique high quality renders\u2b50\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choices that decide what special content you get \ud83d\udd00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flirt with Amelia who will respond to your requests \ud83d\ude08</p>",
